    <title>About me</title>
    <link href="/about/" />
    <updated>2025-02-05T03:22:18Z</updated>
    <id>/about/</id>
    <content xml:lang="" type="html">
      <h2>Hi, I'm Niha. I'm a data scientist and information designer based in Houston, TX.</h2>
<p>I've spent the majority of my career helping organizations in the social impact space get more out of their data. I  hope use this space to share my experiences and learnings, imperfections and all.</p>
<p>Currently, you might find me tinkering with code, reading AI fairness research, or petting my foster dog.</p>
<p>Feel free to connect with me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/niha-pereira/">Linkedin</a>, <a href="https://github.com/nnpereira">Github</a>, or <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/nnpereira.bsky.social">BlueSky</a>.</p>

    </content>
